abstract: >-
  Python and Eigen/OpenMP generators, archive verification, and source provenance
  for clean and disordered half-filling entanglement spectra. The original HDF5
  datasets have a separate Zenodo dataset DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23300020.
keywords:
  - entanglement spectrum
  - Weyl semimetal
  - disorder
  - HDF5
